## Required Output
Write {{.ArtifactDir}}/review.json matching Schema Version 1:
```json
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "decision": "approve | request_changes",
  "summary": "One paragraph summary of review findings.",
  "risk": {
    "side_effect":            { "score": 1-5, "rationale": "..." },
    "performance":            { "score": 1-5, "rationale": "..." },
    "backward_compatibility": { "score": 1-5, "rationale": "..." }
  },
  "findings": [
    { "severity": "blocking | minor", "file": "path/to/file", "line": 42, "description": "..." }
  ],
  "warnings": [
    { "file": "path/to/file", "description": "Pre-existing: ..." }
  ],
  "spec_coverage": [
    { "criterion": "AC-1", "status": "met | partial | not_met", "note": "" }
  ]
}
```

Rules for review.json:
- decision: must be either "approve" or "request_changes".
- risk scores: integers 1 to 5.
- severity: must be either "blocking" or "minor".
- decision "approve" must not contain any "blocking" severity findings.
- findings are strictly scoped to the code changes in the diff.
- warnings capture pre-existing issues or out-of-scope debt and do not block approval.

## Constraints
- Write only to {{.ArtifactDir}}/review.json.
- DO NOT modify any code or other files.
- Do not run git commit.
